# Rockfall net (one-way; top 4 px = walking surface): a d edge rope with an
# i highlight between k lines, a 1 px m diamond mesh (period 8) stretched
# back to a d rope. End tiles: a k-outlined steel post i/m with d clamps
# running down the full tile (decoration). Transparent between the mesh.
# Only the left/right bits change the look.
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
sprite = tile_netz
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
